                                "sense_id": "ebe4a091-27d8-3e93-9ebc-67cbc08b7876",
                                "text": "The analogy here discoverable between the toxins of bacteria and these solvent reagents, or tissue-poisons, is very close, and we are obliged today to employ a similar term to describe the precise action of parasitic fungi to that now employed in bacteriology and to call the diseases which they produce not merely \"zymotic,\" but rather \"zymotoxic.\""
                            }
